flowchart TD
    %% commands: edit.prepare, edit.apply, operation.get
    start([Reviewed insert update or delete draft]) --> eligible{Type provenance and standalone transaction certified}
    eligible -->|No| reject([Reject with reason keep draft])
    eligible -->|Yes| auth[[Fresh authority and schema identity]]
    auth -->|Rejected or manual transaction active| reject
    auth -->|Authorized| admit{Journal admission new intent}
    admit -->|Duplicate| prior([Return existing operation])
    admit -->|Refused| reject
    admit -->|New dispatch intent persisted| tx[Begin standalone transaction]
    tx -->|BEGIN refused without effects| reject
    tx -->|BEGIN disposition unproven| unknown([Outcome unknown no replay])
    tx -->|Opened| next[Next reviewed change]
    next -->|Update or delete| compare[[Lock read and typed original compare]]
    next -->|Insert without existing rowHandle| write[[Bound mutation or proven no-op]]
    compare --> match{Exactly one original match}
    match -->|No| rollback[[Request rollback preserve draft]]
    match -->|Yes| write
    write --> effect{Certified insert effect one or existing-row match one}
    effect -->|No or ambiguous| rollback
    effect -->|Yes including proven matched-one changed-zero| more{More reviewed changes}
    more -->|Yes| next
    more -->|No| commitAuth{Fresh COMMIT authority valid}
    commitAuth -->|No| rollback
    commitAuth -->|Yes| commit[[Persist commit intent and request COMMIT]]
    commit --> confirmed{Observed COMMIT outcome}
    confirmed -->|Unknown| unknown
    confirmed -->|Rollback proved| rolledBack([Supported effects rolled back keep draft])
    confirmed -->|Commit proved| done([Transactional effects committed])
    rollback -->|Rollback confirmed| rolledBack
    rollback -->|Unproven| unknown
